{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fBz7Dvns1O1795649134.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>著名對沖基金經理Michael Burry貝瑞表示，已清空所有納指100空倉，並表明目前好倉比空倉更多。</p><p></p><p>電影《孤注一擲》男主角原形貝瑞向來以做空為主，但他剛發文稱，在全球範圍內，他的投資組合比過去一段時間更偏向好倉，做空更少。他目前除了Palantir及MetLife的看跌期權外，暫時幾乎全部為好倉。</p><p></p><p>他還透過自己在上周五買入輝達的看漲期權，會待市場樂觀情緒升溫，輝達股價接近200美元時，才再次沽空。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.790338+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T23:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T17:37:33.170920+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:17.729814+00:00","content_hash":"04a347901e9f83bf984af9146763803ced5ee9b56d9b00b0b7932d54bd69fa00","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.790338+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}